From: Onigiri
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the cover nav buttons clear of the cameras

Without a cutout, the bar at the bottom of the cover's natural rotation runs under the camera
housing, which hid the home and back buttons and half the gesture handle. Pad the bar past the
housing in that rotation, and narrow back, home and recents so the three buttons fit beside it.
The buttons inflate again when they start or stop fitting there; the gesture handle only needs
the padding. The back gesture edges keep their insets. The bar is left alone when the screen is
not the whole panel: "Hide camera cutout" ends it above the housing, and a mirror fit resizes it.

diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/android/systemui/navigationbar/NavigationBarInflaterView.smali b/smali_classes2/com/android/systemui/navigationbar/NavigationBarInflaterView.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/com/android/systemui/navigationbar/NavigationBarInflaterView.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/android/systemui/navigationbar/NavigationBarInflaterView.smali
